                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-174</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test &lt;tt&gt;parquet-hadoop/src/test/java/parquet/format/converter/TestParquetMetadataConverter.java&lt;/tt&gt; throws an AssertionError using a constructor introduced in Java7.&lt;/p&gt;

